## Candidate 15 (attempted): C14 + also unroll M_inner×4
- Transform succeeded but execute_mlir_code FAILED with parse error ("expected non-function type")
- Root cause: massive unrolled code (K_inner×4 + M_inner×4) caused type corruption in generated MLIR
- Strategy: try smaller unroll factors or unroll different loop

